# Discounted Cash Flow (DCF) Valuation

Assumptions:

```text
Discount Rate: 12%

Terminal Growth Rate: 4%
```

### Terminal Value

```text
TV =
FCF10 × (1 + g)
----------------
(r − g)

=
3.5B × 1.04
------------
0.12 − 0.04

=
45.5B
```

### Enterprise Value

