## Strategic Insight

The most valuable part of CVEN is not the transaction marketplace. The largest long-term value driver is the **AI Growth Intelligence Engine**, which becomes a global forecasting system for governments, investors, universities, corporations, NGOs, and eventually space-development organizations. That transforms CVEN from a platform into an economic operating system for measuring and rewarding civilization-scale growth.
